# PhoneGuard mobile — environment template
#
# Copy to `.env` and adjust. Nothing here is required for local development:
# `src/config/index.ts` falls back to sensible defaults
# (Android emulator -> http://10.0.2.2:3000/api/v1, iOS simulator -> http://localhost:3000/api/v1).
#
# Plain React Native does not read `.env` files by itself. Choose one:
#   * install `react-native-config` (then `pod install` on iOS), or
#   * inject API_URL through EAS secrets / your CI build step, or
#   * build with a `.env`-aware bundler config.
# Every value below is read through `process.env`, so any of those work.

# Base URL of the NestJS API, including the /api/v1 prefix.
# Use your machine's LAN IP for a physical device, e.g. http://192.168.1.20:3000/api/v1
API_URL=http://10.0.2.2:3000/api/v1
